{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：13:56 2026-10-25 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"「騰達勇士」後上爆冷\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/7f593e7253dc4a0ae3b06d874bf6f267/2026-10/r2_6.jpg\"/>\n<p>方嘉柏馬房上周三晚起孖後，今日繼續發動攻勢，在第二場憑「騰達勇士」後上爆岀十一倍冷門贏馬，方嘉柏今季頭馬數字達至十二場，黃智弘今季暫贏得八場頭馬。</p>\n<p>方嘉柏近期手風甚順，剛谷草賽事起孖，今日沙田賽事，在第二場五班千四米由其徒弟黃智弘策騎「騰達勇士」勝出。</p>\n<p>賽後方嘉柏說：「黃智弘今場陣上發揮可圈可點，表現令我非常滿意，他現在可減三磅，要爭取坐騎並不容易，我會繼續支持他，也希望更多人能支持他。如果大家有看『騰達勇士』上一場的賽事重溫，就知道馬兒上場十分欠運，我深信牠在四班有爭勝能力，今仗順利補中。由於此馬的口勁收斂，將來可以跑更長路程，沙田及快活谷也可以應付，稍後會安排牠跑快活谷。」</p>\n<h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/246338d0a72e2c6654536ea175ee0255/2026-10/01a473d0-6c1c-4834-8e44-669fe61c92f6.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/bf1b0475008bc548773689ce6743f7b9/2026-10/6c81b1d2-216d-4004-b124-6a09ba8c9cd2.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/813b7c6296ef8b75709b3008093f88e2/2026-10/6fbed50d-ff0f-4d9d-aa67-eb6ed5b54be7.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/045ebd36cabd5f060cc937c8c03e8140/2026-10/7fe9d63d-7fd5-4480-aaab-dfd95a4d83ae.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/768a0f17f01a4291c020805758f3d143/2026-10/25ffc4a7-7aea-41b1-a397-cd9ee56a0265.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f965967e9a25e093220704903dfeeb0e/2026-10/34cacabd-754c-4506-8a6f-a52d22cc8def.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b9b940dc20d2a2a829631393018bb28e/2026-10/419fb09f-ea87-4402-8c93-68e2a5fa214a.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f9ff47d2d0a818759c9880a8160eb7fa/2026-10/4681aa8d-59f7-49bc-b12d-36d94a4a83dd.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8d141c68bc9d52c6816f81898a786717/2026-10/c306adb2-cc9d-4f81-a797-ed39c81187bc.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/35e4afd4e081b49ad08d3aef4a25adf9/2026-10/de684d08-c757-4d45-b989-b414d09898b1.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/576b81f3db3856e19b69a737f6fbca61/2026-10/f4dfc31c-b189-45d3-9dc3-551bb032f78d.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T07:58:04.250143+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":328,"images":12,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T05:56:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T08:41:07.387545+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T07:51:47.220688+00:00","content_hash":"30a77867f1de21026f8861768962e5708e10f8ef7265513effbef3358cebe2b0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}